## Contributing

Issues and pull requests are welcomed. Please note that pull requests are
accepted only for approved issues.

This repository follows the same two-branch model as NetBox itself:

* `feature` — active development of future releases. **Base your pull
requests on this branch.**
* `main` — the released code. Releases are cut from here; `feature` is
merged into `main` to release.

GitHub defaults the base branch to `main`, so remember to switch the base
to `feature` when opening a pull request.
